<title>RUSSIA: Russia Novokuznetsk aluminium '96 output 268,000 T.</title>
<headline>Russia Novokuznetsk aluminium '96 output 268,000 T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's AO Novokuznetsky Aluminiyevy Zavod produced 268,000 tonnes in 1996, the company's chairman Mikhail Zhivilo said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figure was slightly above industry estimates for output at the plant last year. An industry source pegged production in 1996 at 265,000 tonnes, compared with 256,000 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>The plant's total capacity is 270,000 tonnes, Zhivilo said.</p>
<p>--Dmitry Antonov, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
